I think the guide book should contain ceratin information which is
currently held in the spoilers, information which any character should
know or is trivial gain.

This would include such information as:

The weights of items and what your carrying capacity is.

What non magical tools are available in the game

Basic armour levels

Maybe some description of some of the monsters which are mundane and
some of the higher level monsters and there purported abilities;
creatures which would be heard of through legend. (Though I am not
saying such a list would have to be complete or even correct).

Names associated with each level for each class, someone would surely
know the ranks in there own order.

Race dependent abilities

All these things, and I am sure some others, would be known to anybody
in the nethack universe as this is all part of the mundane society in
which they grew up in. I don't think including any of this information
in the guidebook would detract from nethack or decrease its depth or
complexity. I do think, however, that it would reduce the learning
curve for new people and give them a little better handle on what is
going on when they first starts playing.


